<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>SGE - Control de Calificaciones</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100">

<div class="flex min-h-screen">

    {{>partials/teacher_sidebar}}

    <main class="flex-1 p-8 space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow p-6">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800">✍️ Registro de Entregas y Notas</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 mt-1">Monitoreo en tiempo real de estados de trabajos prácticos de alumnos inscriptos.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow overflow-hidden">
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
                    <thead>
                        <tr class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-500 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-gray-100">
                            <th class="p-5">Estudiante</th>
                            <th class="p-5">Materia / Comisión</th>
                            <th class="p-5">Trabajo Académico</th>
                            <th class="p-5 text-center">Estado actual</th>
                            <th class="p-5 text-center">Calificación</th>
                            <th class="p-5 text-center">Acción</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 text-sm text-gray-700">
                        {{#trackingList}}
                        <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50/80 transition">
                            <td class="p-5 font-semibold text-gray-900">{{student_name}}</td>
                            <td class="p-5">
                                <span class="block font-medium text-slate-800">{{subject_name}}</span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">{{class_name}}</span>
                            </td>
                            <td class="p-5 text-gray-600 font-medium">{{assignment_title}}</td>
                            <td class="p-5 text-center">
                                {{#isFaltaEntregar}}
                                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-red-50 text-red-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold border border-red-100">
                                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span> Falta Entregar
                                </span>
                                {{/isFaltaEntregar}}
                                
                                {{#isTodaviaNoCorrigio}}
                                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold border border-amber-100">
                                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span> Todavía no corrigió
                                </span>
                                {{/isTodaviaNoCorrigio}}
                                
                                {{#isYaCorrigio}}
                                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-green-50 text-green-700 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold border border-green-100">
                                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500"></span> Ya corrigió
                                </span>
                                {{/isYaCorrigio}}
                            </td>
                            <td class="p-5 text-center font-bold text-base text-slate-800">
                                {{#grade}}{{grade}}{{/grade}}
                                {{^grade}}<span class="text-gray-300">—</span>{{/grade}}
                            </td>
                            <td class="p-5 text-center">
                                {{^isFaltaEntregar}}
                                <a href="/teacher/tasks/{{assignment_id}}/submissions"
                                   class="inline-flex items-center bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white font-semibold text-xs px-3 py-2 rounded-lg transition">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-signature mr-1"></i> Corregir
                                </a>
                                {{/isFaltaEntregar}}
                                {{#isFaltaEntregar}}
                                <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 italic">No disponible</span>
                                {{/isFaltaEntregar}}
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        {{/trackingList}}
                        {{^trackingList}}
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="6" class="p-12 text-center text-gray-400 italic">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open text-3xl mb-2 block text-gray-300"></i>
                                No se registran alumnos inscriptos con tareas publicadas en sus comisiones.
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        {{/trackingList}}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

</div>
</body>
</html>